{
  "_comment": [
    "Project permission allowlist. Two tiers:",
    "  1. Read-only inspection — always safe.",
    "  2. Local dev-browser automation — acts only on the preview browser and the",
    "     local dev server (localhost:8090), so its blast radius is this project.",
    "Deliberately NOT allowed, so they still prompt: file deletion/moves, git push/",
    "commit, package installs, and arbitrary shell/interpreter execution",
